### Description

This Terraform program creates a basic AWS CodeBuild project with an associated IAM role and a GitHub source. The IAM role is configured with the necessary permissions for CodeBuild and GitHub access. The CodeBuild project is set up to use this IAM role and is configured to pull source code from a GitHub repository.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "codebuild_service_role" {
  name = "codebuild-service-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "codebuild.amazonaws.com"
        }
      }
    ]
  })

  inline_policy {
    name = "codebuild-policy"
    policy = jsonencode({
      Version = "2012-10-17"
      Statement = [
        {
          Action = [
            "logs:CreateLogGroup",
            "logs:CreateLogStream",
            "logs:PutLogEvents",
            "s3:GetObject",
            "s3:PutObject"
          ]
          Effect = "Allow"
          Resource = "*"
        },
        {
          Action = [
            "github:*"
          ]
          Effect = "Allow"
          Resource = "*"
        }
      ]
    })
  }
}

resource "aws_codebuild_project" "basic_codebuild_project" {
  name         = "basic-codebuild-project"
  service_role = aws_iam_role.codebuild_service_role.arn

  source {
    type            = "GITHUB"
    location        = "https://github.com/example/repo.git"
    report_build_status = true
  }

  environment {
    compute_type = "BUILD_GENERAL1_SMALL"
    image        = "aws/codebuild/amazonlinux2-x86_64-standard:3.0"
    type         = "LINUX_CONTAINER"
  }

  artifacts {
    type = "NO_ARTIFACTS"
  }
}
```

### Explanation

1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-east-1` region.
2. **IAM Role**: An IAM role named `codebuild-service-role` is created with an assume role policy that allows CodeBuild to assume the role. An inline policy is attached to grant necessary permissions for logging, S3 access, and GitHub interactions.
3. **CodeBuild Project**: A CodeBuild project named `basic-codebuild-project` is created. It uses the IAM role created earlier. The source is configured to pull from a GitHub repository. The environment is set up with a small compute type and a standard Linux container image. No artifacts are configured for this basic setup.

