This Terraform program sets up an AWS S3 bucket named 'my_bucket' with forced destruction enabled for cleanup purposes. It also creates an S3 bucket metric named 'my_bucket_metric' to monitor the entire bucket's activity. Additionally, it includes an S3 bucket object named 'my_object' with a specific key and content to be stored in the bucket.

