To address the error reported by the structured verifier feedback, we need to ensure that all attributes are indexed. Specifically, the `name` attribute needs to be part of an index. Since `name` is not being used as a key, we can add it as a global secondary index (GSI).

Here is the corrected Terraform configuration:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_dynamodb_table" "dynamodb_table_us_east_1" {
  name           = "example-table-us-east-1"
  billing_mode   = "PAY_PER_REQUEST"
  hash_key       = "id"

  attribute {
    name = "id"
    type = "S"
  }

  attribute {
    name = "name"
    type = "S"
  }

  global_secondary_index {
    name               = "name-index"
    hash_key           = "name"
    projection_type    = "ALL"
  }
}

