3. **Resource**: The `resource "aws_instance" "example_instance"` block specifies the AMI ID from the data source and sets the CPU options as required.

Make sure to securely manage your AWS credentials and avoid hardcoding them in your Terraform configurations in production environments. Consider using environment variables or AWS IAM roles for better security practices.

