### Description

This Terraform program creates a DAX subnet group by first setting up a VPC and a subnet within that VPC. The DAX subnet group then references the created subnet. The program ensures that all required resources are generated and configured according to the provided contracts and schema summaries.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

