This Terraform configuration sets up an AWS environment with a main VPC, two subnets across different availability zones, and a security group to allow database access. It also configures a 200 GB PostgreSQL RDS instance with public accessibility, linked to the defined subnets and security group, outputting the database endpoint for connectivity.

