### Description
The Terraform program defines an S3 Glacier vault for long-term data archiving in the AWS region `us-west-2`. The vault includes an access policy that allows any principal to initiate a job on the vault. The vault is tagged with "Name" set to "LongTermDataArchivingVault" and "Environment" set to "Production".

### Terraform HCL Program
```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"  # Default region, can be changed as needed
}

resource "aws_glacier_vault" "long_term_data_archiving_vault" {
  name = "long-term-data-archiving-vault"

  # Optional attributes
  access_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = "*"
        Action = "glacier:InitiateJob"
